{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel the world with the Landmarks Pack #1 for Color A Cube!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This globe-spanning DLC brings 10 iconic landmarks to your voxel canvas. From Greek ruins to tulip filled fields, each model is rich in detail and ready for your artistic touch. Whether you're capturing the majesty of the Taj Mahal or adding color to the cozy charm of Burano, the Landmarks Pack #1 is your passport to voxel adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included Models &amp; Voxel Counts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd70 Big Ben \u2013 2,129 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfc Eiffel Tower \u2013 2,577 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfd Statue of Liberty \u2013 2,374 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 Burano, Italy \u2013 6,233 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb Taj Mahal \u2013 6,073 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf37 Dutch Tulip Field \u2013 1,215 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdb The Parthenon \u2013 2,264 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd3a Pyramid of Khafre \u2013 1,277 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfda Stonehenge \u2013 3,738 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfef Gyeongbokgung Palace \u2013 2,180 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a world traveler, history buff, or voxel enthusiast, this pack brings the globe to your fingertips. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855900?t=1751640268","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855900?t=1751640268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855900/9050b9b1a3de43ff2327a6920779f94b5d3e6b43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751640268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855900/9050b9b1a3de43ff2327a6920779f94b5d3e6b43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751640268","c